config KEYSTONE_DRIVER
	tristate "Keystone enclave host driver"
	depends on RISCV
	help
	  Host-side Linux driver for Keystone enclaves. This copy is built from
	  the locked Keystone official VisionFive2 implementation and must match
	  the Security Monitor integrated into the P550 OpenSBI bootchain.
